       研究門檻同改前的彈體門檻：積體電路。 -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="DMSE_ResourceBase">
    <defName>DMSE_Missile_Tochka</defName>
    <label>tactical ballistic missile</label>
    <description>A solid-fuel tactical ballistic missile, fired from a tilted launcher or a vertical launch cell. It climbs high, then dives steeply onto targets far away, accurate enough to hit a depot or command post.</description>
